    "description": "Minimal walker+navigator (NO EXTERNAL REWARD; internal agency-fitness search baked in \u2014 see AGENCY REWARD note below; NOT 'reward-free'): ONLY JointSensorimotorBridge + MotorEPM. The 18 perceptual/cognitive modules (EPMs, voters, NeurochemState, CPG, etc.) are stripped \u2014 they were disconnected from the motor loop (controller reads raw proprio directly), so removing them is behavior-neutral. ~9x fewer modules \u2192 Pi5/embedded-ready. Same-seed equivalence vs the full config proves the perceptual stack is causally disconnected. AGENCY REWARD BAKED IN (2026-06-14): coord_reward_drive 0.3 + coord_stab_penalty 0.3 = (1+1) intent->action gait-phase search with edge-of-chaos guard; validated 1hr/n=3 to sustain gait regularity + 4x net travel vs the bare substrate (docs/findings/agency_reward_gait_results.md). CANONICAL VALIDATED PARAMS: stroke_phase -2.85, amp_target 0.4, coupling_gain 1.55, height_k 0.65, heading_gain 0 (go-straight damper off = 3.6x forward). The higher-energy operator-screenshot set (stroke_phase -1.95, amp_target 0.5, coupling 1.5, height_k 0.72) is EXPERIMENTAL \u2014 see the_picrawler_motor_epm_energetic.json.",
